  "body": "Although #313 obfuscates this somewhat, name targeting happens within a browsing context group. However, it's also that case that using `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy` should give you a fresh name (empty string). In combination this means that name should not have moved to navigable.\r\n\r\nThere's existing tests around COOP for this. Did you end up testing the opposite somewhere?",
